OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning with rain,
OL,6,Fthis lighter and patchy in the west
OL,7,Fbut heavier and more persistent across
OL,8,FTayside and Fife. Rain clearing north
OL,9,Fin the afternoon with some brighter
OL,10,Fintervals developing later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening and
OL,13,Flargely dry with just a few spots of
OL,14,Flight rain possible. Dry overnight
OL,15,Fwith clear spells developing. Rather
OL,16,Fcold.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA mostly dry day with bright
OL,19,For sunny spells. The odd isolated
OL,20,Fshower possible in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
